## Schema Reference

Flashcards in this project follow the schema defined in [src/lib/db/schema.ts](mdc:src/lib/db/schema.ts):
- `front`: text (required, max 1000 chars)
- `back`: text (required, max 1000 chars)
- `position`: integer (for ordering)

The Zod schema for AI generation should match these constraints.

